  "description": "Nikotsu is a Japanese-style display font featuring expressive, irregular letterforms with a hand-drawn appearance. Its distinctive shapes combine bold strokes, playful curves, and unconventional proportions to create a dynamic typographic character inspired by Japanese visual aesthetics. The letterforms have an energetic and organic structure, with varied strokes and unique details that give the typeface a handcrafted appearance. Its expressive construction makes Nikotsu suitable for large display typography where the lettering serves as a prominent graphic element.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Nikotsu is a Japanese-style display font featuring expressive, irregular letterforms with a hand-drawn appearance. Its distinctive shapes combine bold strokes, playful curves, and unconventional proportions to create a dynamic typographic character inspired by Japanese visual aesthetics. The letterforms have an energetic and organic structure, with varied strokes and unique details that give the typeface a handcrafted appearance. Its expressive construction makes Nikotsu suitable for large display typography where the lettering serves as a prominent graphic element.</p>",
